{"title":"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the sum of the digits of the decimal form of the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea479cc13e3907061052f42c91341a9855378561.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1999}\\cdot 5^{2001}$\" width=\"83\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/848c2915f8132ae8d481f10a1ba6eb9a1333e161.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 7\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"360\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/e/65eca0e6cac6497ab87aea9169159937e37f7742.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{1999}\\cdot5^{2001}=2^{1999}\\cdot5^{1999}\\cdot5^{2}=25\\cdot10^{1999}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"325\" height=\"15\" />, a number with the digits \"25\" followed by 1999 zeros. The sum of the digits in the decimal form would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/a/b0ab00acd55b7e25740fd537f007cb71a48303dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+5=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />, thus making the answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94bf9089f3c0ad5ee9fca030cfb06b487e559902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{D}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME\" title=\"1999 AHSME\">1999 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1999 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1999\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1999 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?ti